    "https://careers.westfield.ma.edu/account/guests/": {
      "title": "Become a Career Contributor",
      "description": "Guest Contributor – Career Center | Westfield State University Class of 2025, take our Post-Graduate Outcomes Survey to let us know where you landed after WSU! Skip to content Skip to AI Search Search Keywords Log in Sign up Guests Career Center Instagram LinkedIn Pinterest X (formerly Twitter) YouTube Schedule an Appointment Donate Become a Career Contributor Engage Westfield State University students by posting on Career Center. It's quick and easy but contact us if you have any questions. Post a Blog Feature a Job Create an Employer Profile Promote an Event Feature a Class Share Your Story Complete the reCAPTCHA to get started. Next Powered by\n                            uConnect Contact & Location Phone 413-572-5206 Email careers@westfield.ma.edu Website https://careers.westfield.ma.edu/ Address Westfield State University Parenzo Hall, 130 577 Western Avenue Westfield, MA 01086 Career Service Hours Day of the week Hours of Operation Summer Hours M Monday 8:30 am- 4:30 pm 8:00 am- 4:00 pm T Tuesday 8:30 am- 4:30 pm 8:00 am- 4:00 pm W Wednesday 8:30 am- 4:30 pm 8:00 am- 4:00 pm TH Thursday 8:30 am- 4:30 pm 8:00 am- 4:00 pm F Friday 8:30 am- 4:30 pm 8:00 am- 4:00 pm Meet the Team Junior Delgado Meet Junior Giselle Frechette Meet Giselle Dino Innarelli Meet Dino Sharon Welch Meet Sharon Lori Putnam Meet Lori Chelsea Rose-Dunham Meet Chelsea Sarah Kraft Meet Sarah Phone 413-572-5206 Email careers@westfield.ma.edu Website https://careers.westfield.ma.edu/ Address Westfield State University Parenzo Hall, 130 577 Western Avenue Westfield, MA 01086 Footer Column 1 Alumni Connections Events Experiences Footer Column 2 Jobs & Internships Organizations Resources Meet the Team Instagram LinkedIn Pinterest X (formerly Twitter) YouTube Privacy Policy | Terms of Service Copyright © 2026 Westfield State University"
