    "https://careers.westfield.ma.edu/channels/business-management/": {
      "title": "Business Management",
      "description": "Business Management – Career Center | Westfield State University Class of 2025, take our Post-Graduate Outcomes Survey to let us know where you landed after WSU! Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Search Keywords Log in Sign up Guests Career Center Instagram LinkedIn Pinterest X (formerly Twitter) YouTube Schedule an Appointment Donate Students & Alumni Explore Career Pathways Discovery & Exploration Job Trends & Salaries Arts, Media, Marketing & Communications Business Management Counseling & Social Justice Criminal Justice, Government & Law Education Finance & Accounting Health & Fitness Information Technology Science & Math Additional Resources for Students Job Boards, Networking & Career Support Employers Employer Sponsorship Register for a Career Fair Recruiting Options Faculty & Staff Career Champions Prospective Students WSU Career Fairs & Events Meet the Team Business Management Career Exploration Resumes & Cover Letters Virtual Case Studies with Top Employers Internship Search Job Search Explore Job Market Hiring Trends Featured Opportunities Interview Prep Graduate School LinkedIn & Networking Explore Career Paths & Current Job Market Explore Hiring Employers & In-Demand Jobs Virtual Case Studies with Top Employers On-Campus Employment Skip filter options to posts Facing Career Fears: Video Series Filter Clear Filters See More Filters Filter Controls Blog Categories: Alumni Stories Career & Professional Development Advice Employer Spotlights Front Page News Guest Blog Industry Insights Student Stories Close Clear Filters Advice from Graduates (2:54) Share This: Share Advice from Graduates (2:54) on Facebook Share Advice from Graduates (2:54) on LinkedIn Share Advice from Graduates (2:54) on X Copy Link By Giselle Frechette Show author info Giselle Frechette Associate Director Send Email linkedin Read more » What I Wish I Knew (3:09) Share This: Share What I Wish I Knew (3:09) on Facebook Share What I Wish I Knew (3:09)