ild confidence, develop body awareness, and enjoy being active. This role … View more and apply Brass Instructor American Music Institute Share This: Share Brass Instructor on Facebook Share Brass Instructor on LinkedIn Share Brass Instructor on X Copy Link Recruitment began on September 4, 2026 and the job listing Expires on October 5, 2026 Full-time, Part-time Teaching Positions Open American Music Institute, located in the Western suburbs of Chicago, has the following positions open at its Clarendon Hills Campus: Brass (Trombone, Trumpet) QUALIFICATIONSMinimum Degree – Bachelors2+ years experience teaching experienceDeliver high-quality instruction to students of all agesProvide assessment of student’s musical progressCollaborate with parents, administrative staff for scheduling, etcTimely correspondence with director, school staff, and parentsLives in the Chicago area and have reliable transportationActively participate in faculty meetingsAbility to communicate instrumental techniques and concepts to studentsHigh … View more and apply Winds Instructor American Music Institute Share This: Share Winds Instructor on Facebook Share Winds Instructor on LinkedIn Share Winds Instructor on X Copy Link Recruitment began on September 4, 2026 and the job listing Expires on October 5, 2026 Full-time, Part-time Teaching Positions Open American Music Institute, located in the Western suburbs of Chicago, has the following positions open at it’s Clarendon Hills Campus: Winds (Flute) QUALIFICATIONSMinimum Degree – Bachelors2+ years experience teaching experienceDeliver high-quality instruction to students of all agesProvide assessment of student’s musical progressCollaborate with parents, administrative staff for scheduling, etcTimely correspondence with director, school staff, and parentsLives in the Chicago area and have reliable transportationActively participate in faculty meetingsAbility to communicate instrumental techniques and concepts to studentsHigh level … View more a