itute Share This: Share Guitar Instructor on Facebook Share Guitar Instructor on LinkedIn Share Guitar Instructor on X Copy Link Recruitment began on September 4, 2026 and the job listing Expires on October 5, 2026 Full-time, Part-time Teaching Positions Open American Music Institute, located in the Western suburbs of Chicago, has the following positions open at it’s Clarendon Hills Campus: Guitar QUALIFICATIONSMinimum Degree – Bachelors2+ years experience teaching experienceDeliver high-quality instruction to students of all agesProvide assessment of student’s musical progressCollaborate with parents, administrative staff for scheduling, etcTimely correspondence with director, school staff, and parentsLives in the Chicago area and have reliable transportationActively participate in faculty meetingsAbility to communicate instrumental techniques and concepts to studentsHigh level of … View more and apply Urban Impact Fellow Urban Impact Foundation Share This: Share Urban Impact Fellow on Facebook Share Urban Impact Fellow on LinkedIn Share Urban Impact Fellow on X Copy Link Recruitment began on September 4, 2026 and the job listing Expires on October 5, 2026 Full-time, Part-time Urban Impact Fellowship The Fellows program is a year-long apprenticeship in inner-city ministry. The Fellows are trained and equipped in these targeted areas: Developing ministry and cross-cultural skills through specific training and experience in ministry within Urban Impact. A better understanding of theology and apologetics Discerning God’s call to ministry or not. Would help with our athletics department, education department, performing arts department, options department (career skills, mentorship, and future planning for high schoolers), training center (runs mission trips and … View more and apply Part Time – Client Experience Team DivaDance Company Share This: Share Part Time – Client Experience Team on Facebook Share Part Time – Client Experience Team on LinkedIn Share Part Time – Client Experience Team on X Copy Link Recruitment began on September 3, 2026 and the job listing Expires on October 4, 2026 Full-time, Part-time ABOUT US:DivaDance is a sexy, sweaty, stress-free dance experience for adults! We are the #1 brand for pop-music inspired, choreography-based dance classes, programs, and parties – with franchises in over 40 cities. Joining our staff is an opportunity to change lives, empower others, and do what you love as we inspire confidence and build community in our inclusive, all-levels classes. THE GIG: We’re looking for a confident, persuasive individual who is ready to CHANGE LIVES through sales of our inclusive, … View more and apply Part-Time Dance Instructor/Choreographer DivaDance Company Share This: Share Part-Time Dance Instructor/Choreographer on Facebook Share Part-Time Dance Instructor/Choreographer on LinkedIn Share Part-Time Dance Instructor/Choreographer on X Copy Link Recruitment began on September 3, 2026 and the job listing Expires on October 4, 2026 Full-time, Part-time ABOUT US: DivaDance is the #1 brand for pop-music inspired, choreography-based dance classes, live performance programs, video shoots, workshopsand parties – with franchises across the US and in Mexico. Joining our staff is an opportunity to change lives, empower others, and do what you love as we inspire confidence and build community in our inclusive, all-levels classes. We offer flexible working hours, professional development opportunities, leadership growth paths (including pathways to your own franchise ownership), and the exciting (and fun!) … View more and apply Pages: Page 1 Page 2 Page 3 … Page 50 Contact & Location Phone 413-572-5206 Email careers@westfield.ma.edu Website https://careers.westfield.ma.edu/ Address Westfield State University Parenzo Hall, 130 577 Western Avenue Westfield, MA 01086 Career Service Hours Day of the week Hours of Operation Summer Hours M Monday 8:30 am- 4:30 pm 8:00 am- 4:00 pm T Tuesday 8:30 am- 4:30 pm 8:00 am- 4:00 pm W Wednesday 8:30 am- 4:30 pm 8:00 am- 4:00 pm TH Thursday 8:30 am- 4:30 pm 8:00 am- 4:00 pm F Friday 8:30 am- 4:30 pm 8:00 am- 4:00 pm Meet the Team Junior Delgado Meet Junior Giselle Frechette Meet Giselle Dino Innarelli Meet Dino Sharon Welch Meet Sharon Lori Putnam Meet Lori Chelsea Rose-Dunham Meet Chelsea Sarah Kraft Meet Sarah Phone 413-572-5206 Email careers@westfield.ma.edu Website https://careers.westfield.ma.edu/ Address Westfield State University Parenzo Hall, 130 577 Western Avenue Westfield, MA 01086 Footer Column 1 Alumni Connections Events Experiences Footer Column 2 Jobs & Internships Organizations Resources Meet the Team Instagram LinkedIn Pinterest X (formerly Twitter) YouTube Privacy Policy | Terms of Service Copyright © 2026 Westfield State University"
